Phase AV (M666-M685): 多游戏协议适配层 + 跨游戏迁移学习基础
- M666: GameProtocolAdapterBase — 抽象基类含FSM状态机
- M667: LolProtocolAdapter — LoL Live Client Data API适配
- M668: Dota2ProtocolAdapter — Dota2 GSI协议适配
- M669: MahjongProtocolAdapter — 雀魂MITM协议适配(mjai/protobuf)
- M670: UniversalGameStateSchema — 跨游戏统一状态schema
- M671: CrossGameRewardNormalizer — 奖励归一化(zscore/tanh/minmax)
- M672: CrossGameActionSpaceUnifier — 动作空间统一编解码
- M673: CrossGameTrainingDataFormatter — 训练数据(state,action,reward)格式化
- M674: GameAdapterRegistry — 适配器注册表含热插拔
- M675: TransferLearningFeatureAligner — 迁移学习特征对齐
- M676: CrossGameModelHub — 模型中心含血缘追踪
- M677: ProtocolAdapterTestHarness — 适配器标准化兼容性测试
- M678: CrossGamePerformanceComparator — 跨游戏表现对比
- M679: GameSpecificDecoderFactory — 解码器工厂含实例缓存
- M680: CrossGameCoachingTemplateEngine — 跨游戏教练模板引擎
- M681: CrossGameTelemetryAggregator — 跨游戏遥测聚合
- M682: GameKnowledgeTransferEngine — 策略知识迁移引擎
- M683: MultiGameSessionManager — 多游戏会话管理
- M684: CrossGameEvolutionTracker — 跨游戏自演化追踪
- M685: MultiGamePipelineOrchestrator — 多游戏管线总编排

Phase AW (M686-M705): 自主决策循环 + 实时协议驱动行动执行
- M686: AutonomousDecisionStateMachine — 决策FSM(IDLE→OBSERVING→ANALYZING→DECIDING→EXECUTING→REVIEWING)
- M687: ActionPriorityQueue — 行动优先级队列含TTL过期
- M688: RealtimeRiskAssessor — 实时风险评估(safe/caution/danger/critical)
- M689: GamePhaseDetector — 对局阶段检测(early/mid/late/endgame)
- M690: TacticalIntentReasoner — 战术意图推理(push/farm/defend/gank/objective/retreat)
- M691: ActionExecutorBridge — 行动执行器桥接含dry-run
- M692: ActionFeedbackCollector — 行动反馈收集器含有效性评分
- M693: DecisionLogReplayer — 决策日志回放器含时间轴seek
- M694: OnlinePolicyAdjuster — 在线策略调整(无需重训练)
- M695: MultiObjectiveBalancer — 多目标Pareto权衡
- M696: TeamCoordinationReasoner — 团队协调推理(engage/disengage/poke)
- M697: ResourceAllocationOptimizer — 资源分配优化
- M698: VisionControlReasoner — 视野控制推理
- M699: TimingWindowScheduler — 时间窗口调度
- M700: ActionSequencePlanner — 多步行动序列规划
- M701: DecisionExplanationGenerator — 决策解释生成(brief/normal/detailed)
- M702: DecisionQualityScorer — 决策质量评分含偏差检测
- M703: RealtimeDashboardDataSource — 实时仪表盘数据源(SSE/poll)
- M704: DecisionPipelineHealthGuard — 管线健康守卫含自动降级
- M705: AutonomousDecisionOrchestrator — 自主决策总编排器(30分钟持续运行)

